# Pages, routing, layouts

- **Blog:** Index `src/pages/blog/index.astro`; posts `src/pages/blog/posts/[...slug].astro` with `getCollection("posts")` — layout `BlogLayout`.
- **Legal:** `src/pages/legal/[...slug].astro` + `getCollection("legal")` — `LegalLayout`; some routes set `trailingSlash: false` in `getStaticPaths`.
- **Store:** `src/pages/store/index.astro`, `src/pages/store/[...slug].astro` — `StoreLayout`.
- **Sites directory:** Detail `src/pages/sites/site/[...slug].astro` — `SitesLayout` (URL prefix `/sites/site/`). Tag pages under `src/pages/sites/tags/`.
- **Homepage:** `src/pages/index.astro` uses `BaseLayout` with `showSearch={true}` like other search-heavy pages.
- **RSS:** `src/pages/rss.xml.js` — verify `import.meta.glob` paths match real files if the feed must work (current glob targets `./blog/*` under `pages`, while MD entries live under `src/content/posts/`).
- When adding a route, follow the same `getStaticPaths` + `getCollection` + `render` pattern as sibling files.
